# kit/claude/item-detail/cut 160x45 @89,1 (71x8)
wrong · seen 3× · 2 days ago
pi's permission gate cannot resolve shell variables, so cat
$S/id_ed25519 reads what cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519 denies.

Why the repo didn't say it
The docs describe the gate as matching on the command text, and nothing
says the text is not expanded first.
